The following uses or conditions shall be and are hereby prohibited within the wellhead protection zones, whether or not such use or condition may otherwise be ordinarily included as a part of a use permitted under section 26-52:
(1) Surface use or storage of material, expressly including commercial use of agricultural pesticides;
(2) Septic tanks or drain fields appurtenant thereto;
(3) Impervious surfaces other than roofs of buildings and streets, driveways and walks serving buildings permitted under section 26-52;
(4) Sanitary landfills;
(5) Hazardous waste disposal sites;
(6) Stormwater infiltration basins;
(7) Underground storage tanks;
(8) Sanitary sewer lines within 150 feet of a wellhead.
(Ord. of 9-10-2001, § 5(1))
